OL,3,GNEWSABiker sees life differently after
OL,4,Adefying death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA biker who was on the verge of death
OL,7,Fhas said he now looks at life
OL,8,Fdifferently three years on from a race
OL,9,Fthat very nearly became his last.
OL,11,FAllan Lain, from Inkberrow, in
OL,12,FWorcestershire, had been competing at
OL,13,FMallory Park Racing Circuit in
OL,14,FLeicestershire when, without warning,
OL,15,Feverything went black.
OL,17,FWhen he woke up three days later from
OL,18,Fan induced coma he was battered and
OL,19,Fbruised, not from the fall, but from
OL,20,Fthe frantic efforts to keep him alive
OL,21,Fafter he suffered a cardiac arrest.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
