OL,3,GNEWSABiker sees life differently after
OL,4,Adefying death
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I lifted up my gown and my chest was
OL,7,Fcompletely black and blue but that was
OL,8,Ffrom the CPR," the 53-year-old said.
